+    /// This run (second author on 15d7): the boundary-comb deletion's adversarial arm — B13's assist
+    /// draws, the near-escape class the 3b88 wall belongs to — each flown with the gate off and on.
+    /// Per draw the outcome (alive, kicks, refused, lost, the 1% class, the tubes digest) must be
